WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:03.360
Since there's a river to the west

00:03.440 --> 00:05.107
And grass on the hills

00:05.320 --> 00:07.240
The Wuzhao's main force is cavalry

00:07.320 --> 00:08.600
Their warhorses

00:08.680 --> 00:09.800
Are like their wives

00:09.880 --> 00:11.040
And sons

00:11.120 --> 00:12.240
So

00:12.320 --> 00:14.600
Their main force should be in the west

00:14.680 --> 00:16.200
To avoid the enemy's main force

00:16.280 --> 00:17.160
Tonight

00:17.240 --> 00:18.640
Raid the eastern camp

00:18.840 --> 00:19.920
Brother-in-law

00:20.000 --> 00:21.760
I ask to lead the cavalry out of the city

00:21.840 --> 00:23.720
They are all brothers who have followed me

00:23.800 --> 00:25.400
Since I joined the army

00:25.480 --> 00:27.280
Each willing to fight to the death

